        <lem wit="#A #B #C #D #F">Proye, </lem>
        <rdg wit="#E">proye, </rdg>
      </app>
</l>

<l n="187">
Le 
      <app>
        <lem wit="#A #B #C #D #F">Sort, </lem>
        <rdg wit="#E">sort, </rdg>
      </app>
dont les 
      <app>
        <lem wit="#A #B #F">Arrests </lem>
        <rdg wit="#C #D #E">arrests </rdg>
      </app>
furent alors 
      <app>
        <lem wit="#C #D #E #F">suivis, </lem>
        <rdg wit="#A #B">suiuis, </rdg>
      </app>
</l>

<l n="188">
Fit tomber en mes mains Andromaque &amp; son Fils. </l>

<l n="189">
Hécube, 
